			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule — Grove reformat, Vine terminal/SCM/language registry\n\nAdvance the Element submodule pointer to 079fec72, integrating updates across Grove and Vine.\n\nGrove reformats `Source/Transport/Strategy.rs` — splits `connect`, `send`, `close` method chains onto separate lines across gRPC, IPC, WASM, and WebSocket variants to match organization formatting standards.\n\nVine expands the `VineHost` trait surface: implements `TerminalLifecycle` and `WindowCreateTerminal` to bridge Cocoon PTY requests with native providers, adds `RegisterScmProvider`/`RegisterScmResourceGroup` for SCM viewlet integration, and introduces a centralized `RegisterLanguageProvider` dispatcher that normalizes 46+ wire method names to standardized `TypeName` identifiers before routing to the embedder registry.\n\nExtension-driven terminal sessions, SCM provider registration, and full VS Code language intelligence features are now supported via the gRPC notification surface.",
